  "summary": "Sub-1 GHz (315/433/868/915 MHz bands) FSK/GFSK/ASK/OOK/MSK transceiver, up to +12 dBm; 4-wire SPI slave plus GDO0/GDO2 general outputs (IRQ/FIFO status); 26-27 MHz crystal with EXTERNAL load caps (no internal trim); 1.8-3.6 V; no reset pin (reset by SRES strobe). Encoded for the 868/915 MHz band: the Figure 11 balun + LC filter with Table 21 values runs from RF_P/RF_N to node:rf, a 50 ohm single-ended antenna port (no RF switch needed). The optional C126/L125 699 MHz filter is omitted. For 315/433 MHz the network topology and values differ (Figure 10, Table 21)",
